  retrato: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 87aa25332e49bdd4a9454129308c94f8, type: 3}
  dayGreeting: "Hello. Who are you? Why are you talking to me if I don\u2019t know
    you? Are you going to kill me?"
  dayFarewell: "On the other hand, to get to know someone, you first have to be strangers...
    I\u2019m confused."
  nightText: "Huh? You again? I don\u2019t want to get to know you! Some strangers
    are just that: strangers."
